				"name": "Villain Monologue",
				"description": "*“We’re all marionettes in the hands of fate. It doesn’t really matter whether I kill you or you kill me. Although I happen to know that that last one is not going to happen.”*",
				"echelon": 1,
				"prerequisites": "You gave a monologue to an enemy right before you killed them.",
